 lg:static"><button aria-label="Switch to light theme" class="grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-line text-muted transition-colors hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" color="currentColor" class="" stroke-width="1.8" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M17 12C17 14.7614 14.7614 17 12 17C9.23858 17 7 14.7614 7 12C7 9.23858 9.23858 7 12 7C14.7614 7 17 9.23858 17 12Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"></path><path d="M12 2V3.5M12 20.5V22M19.0708 19.0713L18.0101 18.0106M5.98926 5.98926L4.9286 4.9286M22 12H20.5M3.5 12H2M19.0713 4.92871L18.0106 5.98937M5.98975 18.0107L4.92909 19.0714" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.8"></path></svg></button></header><main class="grid flex-1 content-start items-center gap-8 pb-10 lg:content-center lg:py-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-10"><section class="max-w-sm"><p class="text-sm text-muted">Hi, I’m</p><h1 class="mt-1 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Aryan<!-- -->.</h1><div class="mt-3 space-y-4 text-sm leading-normal text-muted lg:mt-6 lg:text-[15px] lg:leading-relaxed"><p>I'm a web developer and creative coder. I work where design meets engineering: fluid interfaces, rendering pipelines, and the low-level mechanics that make software feel alive rather than just functional.</p><p class="hidden lg:block">By day I build web interfaces at StrideOne. The rest of the time I make command-line tools, libraries and small experiments, like zeal, a jq for logs.</p></div><ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm lg:mt-6"><li><a href="https://github.com/aryanjha256" data-shape="logo:github" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="border-b border-line pb-0.5 transition-colors hover:border-fg">GitHub<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-0.5 text-muted">↗</span></a></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thearyankumar" data-shape="logo:linkedin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="border-b border-line pb-0.5 transition-colors hover:border-fg">LinkedIn<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-0.5 text-muted">↗</span></a></li><li><a href="https://x.com/aryaninsync" data-shape="logo:x" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="border-b border-line pb-0.5 transition-colors hover:border-fg">X<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-0.5 text-muted">↗</span></a></li><li><a href="/resume.pdf" data-shape="logo:resume" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="border-b border-line pb-0.5 transition-colors hover:border-fg">Résumé<span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-0.5 text-muted">↗</span></a></li></ul></section><div aria-hidden="true" class="h-72 w-full sm:h-96 lg:aspect-square lg:h-auto lg:max-w-[min(48rem,calc(100dvh-13rem))] lg:justify-self-center"></div><section class="w-full max-w-md lg:justify-self-end"><div><div role="tablist" aria-label="Lists" class="flex gap-6 border-b border-line"><button role="tab" id="_R_dlflb_-tab-0" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="_R_dlflb_-panel-0" class="-mb-px border-b pb-2.5 text-sm transition-colors border-fg text-fg">Projects<sup class="ml-0.5 text-[10px] tabular-nums text-muted">06</sup></button><button role="tab" id="_R_dlflb_-tab-1" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="_R_dlflb_-panel-1" class="-mb-px border-b pb-2.5 text-sm transition-colors border-transparent text-muted hover:text-fg">Work<sup class="ml-0.5 text-[10px] tabular-nums text-muted">04</sup></button><button role="tab" id="_R_dlflb_-tab-2" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="_R_dlflb_-panel-2" class="-mb-px border-b pb-2.5 text-sm transition-colors border-transparent text-muted hover:text-fg">Life<sup class="ml-0.5 text-[10px] tabular-nums text-muted">06</sup></button></div><div class="grid"><ol id="_R_dlflb_-panel-0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="_R_dlflb_-tab-0" class="grid grid-cols-2 content-start gap-x-4 [grid-area:1/1] lg:block "><li data-shape="project:zuno" data-summary="A ridi